      "toolMethod": "Select grids, pick sorting direction (Left-to-Right for vertical grids, Top-to-Bottom for horizontal grids), set starting letter/number, and click Rename. The tool executes an automated 2-pass transaction (temp rename ➔ final rename) with zero duplicate name conflicts.",
